  "label": "Toxic Attitude Toward Differentness",
  "description": "The meme promotes a toxic attitude that equates being 'different' or 'unpleasant' with being inherently 'disgusting' and deserving of hatred. This attitude is harmful because it normalizes contempt and dehumanization toward those who are perceived as 'dirty', 'unrefined', or 'unacceptable' by societal standards.",
